# 行尾策略：仓库里统一存 LF，检出时把批处理 / PowerShell 还原成 CRLF
# （cmd 解析批处理必须是 CRLF，否则会把内嵌的 PowerShell 正文当命令执行）
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.txt text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做任何换行转换
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.ttc binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.bmp binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
